{
  "bookId": "rewind-13",
  "id": "chapter-58",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16500001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "大礼堂——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "在很久很久以前，森林深处的豪华古堡里，\n居住着一位高贵又美丽的白雪公主，和十八位忠心耿耿的小矮人——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "豪华古堡？不是逃难去的破木……唔唔唔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘘，戏剧模仿赛就不要在意这些细节啦，好好听规则呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "尽管受到尊贵的公主艾伦兹大人的庇佑，神秘的古堡里，\n仍然存在着种种不可言说或触碰的禁忌……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "看来有一些禁用词和违规行为呢，不如先看看其他人的动向吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "既然是戏剧模仿，围绕公主展开总不会出错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "……就这样，寻常又不寻常的一天，从清晨展开了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "唔，睡得真好啊~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "阿，公主，您的眼眸如同清晨的朝露，唇瓣如同鲜艳的玫瑰，\n气质如同山巅的皑雪，嗓音如同天界的仙乐——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "噗……阿，咳咳，那是，咳，学生会长吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "能用这么一本正经的语气念出……噗……哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "优纪选手，你出局了，请离场前往观众席。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……怎么会这样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16500015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "小矮人守则第一条，出戏即出局。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "哼，行了，你退下吧。\n来人，吾要起床！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Morning，公主殿下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "今天的早点有cheese和pancake，您想吃哪个呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "伊达政宗选手，你出局了，请离场前往观众席。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "小矮人守则第二条，禁止提及美食。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "美食？你怎么知道不是因为说了英文？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "嗯，没听清，能再说一遍吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "我说，美——食——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "吕布选手，你出局了，请离场前往观众席。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "看，现在不就知道了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "哎（摇头）。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "哼，下一位！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯塔罗斯",
          "text": "公主大人，今天您的行程有，点评后院新打理的的小花园，\n清点本月的古堡收支账目，还……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "阿斯塔罗斯大人，您出局了，请离场前往观众席。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "小矮人守则第三条，禁止提及事务及账目相关语句。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "唔嗯~越来越有趣了嘛……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "要帮忙吗，我可以让这里，变得更有趣喔~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501018",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "感觉要被杀掉了！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "菠萝熊",
          "text": "杀掉了！杀掉了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "呼，这一条就不要记了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16501021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "同意，大声喧哗不是绅士所为。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-357",
