      ],
      "title": "春和景明终篇·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16530001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "text": "时间过得飞快，就这样，持续了一整月的柯斯顿庆典也进入尾声——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "算起来，今天已经是庆典的第二十九天了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "托龙王大人的福，度过了非常热闹愉快的一段时光呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "要是一年十二个月，每个月都有庆典就好了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "那就要有整整三个月的时间，在路上派发邀请函了喔~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "这段时间叨扰了，非常感谢你们对庆典的帮忙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "才不会，大家都很乐在其中呢，主人也觉得这样很有趣，对吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "16530009",
              "text": "非常有意思。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "16530009",
              "text": "很高兴能帮上忙。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "16530008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "叮铃——叮铃——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "喔，那是什么声音？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇，是风铃！\n——好漂亮的风铃阿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "春日的风铃，是好运降临的兆头。\n如果趁机向龙王许下祝福，一定会应验哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，谢谢龙王大人！让我想想……要许个什么愿望~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "不如我们每人各自写下祝福，系在树枝上吧，看上去很有节日氛围呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "我去拿纸笔，房间里还有许多彩色丝带。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人主人~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "16530018",
              "text": "怎么了，优纪？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "16530018",
              "text": "嗯？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "16530017",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，主人，我想把风铃挂在树枝上，可是那里太高了嘛~\n可不可以拜托主人帮帮我~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "16530020",
              "text": "当然。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "16530019",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "(轻轻用手托起捧着风铃的优纪)",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530021",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "春风和煦，大家兴奋地讨论着各自写下的祝福——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "葵又在写要睡很多觉、麻烦都走开一类的东西了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "没有，希望每天的阳光都像今天这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "想好要写什么了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "每天都在想喔~哎……不要偷看！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "换个愿望吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "嗯？……你不喜欢的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "想什么呢，太浪费了，那种愿望不需要祈求神明。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "我会一直在你身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "警探大人，如果认真请求的话，我可以考虑分你一点运气喔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "那种东西，还是留给你自己。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "希望新的一年，大家也能幸福平安。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "绿子很可疑喔，不会在偷偷……写某个让人结结巴巴的名字吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530034",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "说，说什么呢……我觉得还是祝某位过气明星重归舞台更好一点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "就算这样，我也不会对你感恩戴德喔。\n不过，作为礼尚往来，那我祝绿子新的一年，更有女人味一点好了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "主人和Miku不见了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是走散了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16530038",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "主人——Miku——你们在哪里呀——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-360",
      "sourceRefs": [
