      ],
      "title": "春和景明终篇·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16540001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "叮——叮——咚——咚——铃——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是风铃声。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "主人在那边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "喔，他们在那边，看起来Miku在风铃上玩得很开心阿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "原来如此，利用风铃的不同阶位和材质奏出音律吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "这番景致可以称得上风雅了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "很有意思嘛，小龙，带我上去——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇，等等我，我也要玩！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "酷！新的跳舞机游戏吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "跳舞！跳舞！哈莉！跳舞！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "你不去吗，大家都冲上去了，再不快点就没位置了喔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "这才是舞台该有的样子吧，把自己的热情和心意传递给在场的每一个人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "看起来，音律和武道也有共通之处，我还要更用心领悟才行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "喂，那边两个，不要践踏草坪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "糟了，是风纪委员。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "菠萝熊",
          "text": "天塌下来了，要被风纪委员抓到了！~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你们两个也稍微适可而止……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔·小甜甜",
          "text": "难得的日子，随他们去吧……哎，要检查我的舞蹈练习成果吗，老，师？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "真好阿，太阳晒在身上的感觉……对吧，葵？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呣……懒洋洋的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "天气变暖了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "嗯，三月到了，春天来了……今年变得幸运起来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "会的哟，嘿嘿，大家都会变得超幸运的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540024",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "就这样，饱受赞誉的柯斯顿城盛典，在春暖花开之际圆满谢幕——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16540025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "带着龙王艾伦兹的祝福，大家迎来了崭新的一年——",
